{"2050370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rental Commander", "steam_appid": 2050370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to take control of a vehicle in an RTS game and show them how its done? Rental Commander brings a mix of RTS/Auto-Battler/Action Vehicle Combat where you can take control of a small squad of vehicles from a over 20 available options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/c6330118538cae411addcfbcf9df930e.poster.avif?t=1783544725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/c6330118538cae411addcfbcf9df930e.webm?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/c6330118538cae411addcfbcf9df930e.mp4?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head to head against up to 5 players (5 v 5) in a co-op/pvp battle, bringing exciting vehicular combat into a space setting with ground and air vehicles that you can use to dominate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rental Commander comes with an array of different vehicles including Light Armour for speed, Anti-Air to protect the skies, Heavy Armor to push bases and VTOL craft to unleash destruction from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/d3637beee0ecd9ebac0cb62e211f6dd5.poster.avif?t=1783544725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/d3637beee0ecd9ebac0cb62e211f6dd5.webm?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/d3637beee0ecd9ebac0cb62e211f6dd5.mp4?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 vehicles to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/7e65ba6ad9a039b3da015aa06ba8b4b3.poster.avif?t=1783544725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/7e65ba6ad9a039b3da015aa06ba8b4b3.webm?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/7e65ba6ad9a039b3da015aa06ba8b4b3.mp4?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your arsenal with talent trees and power-ups available to be used in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/6469c8b8ea7bf292a152fd12b76c257e.poster.avif?t=1783544725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/6469c8b8ea7bf292a152fd12b76c257e.webm?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/6469c8b8ea7bf292a152fd12b76c257e.mp4?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to take control of a vehicle in an RTS game and show them how its done? Rental Commander brings a mix of RTS/Auto-Battler/Action Vehicle Combat where you can take control of a small squad of vehicles from a over 20 available options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/c6330118538cae411addcfbcf9df930e.poster.avif?t=1783544725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/c6330118538cae411addcfbcf9df930e.webm?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/c6330118538cae411addcfbcf9df930e.mp4?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head to head against up to 5 players (5 v 5) in a co-op/pvp battle, bringing exciting vehicular combat into a space setting with ground and air vehicles that you can use to dominate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rental Commander comes with an array of different vehicles including Light Armour for speed, Anti-Air to protect the skies, Heavy Armor to push bases and VTOL craft to unleash destruction from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/d3637beee0ecd9ebac0cb62e211f6dd5.poster.avif?t=1783544725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/d3637beee0ecd9ebac0cb62e211f6dd5.webm?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/d3637beee0ecd9ebac0cb62e211f6dd5.mp4?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 vehicles to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/7e65ba6ad9a039b3da015aa06ba8b4b3.poster.avif?t=1783544725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/7e65ba6ad9a039b3da015aa06ba8b4b3.webm?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/7e65ba6ad9a039b3da015aa06ba8b4b3.mp4?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your arsenal with talent trees and power-ups available to be used in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/6469c8b8ea7bf292a152fd12b76c257e.poster.avif?t=1783544725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/6469c8b8ea7bf292a152fd12b76c257e.webm?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050370/extras/6469c8b8ea7bf292a152fd12b76c257e.mp4?t=1783544725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A sci-fi action RTS style game where you drive and pilot the vehicles. Go head to head in a 5 v 5 battle of the ages. Rent and command your squad in this hybrid RTS/Auto-Battler/Action Vehicle Combat conflict.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages w